    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6759" root="جول" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَائِلٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَوِيلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Rainless clouds going
round about.</i> (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And, applied to a
[woman's ornament of the kind termed] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وِشَاح</span>,
and to a camel's belly-girth, <i>Loose; not tight;
unsteady;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَالٍ</span></b> . (T, TA.) [Hence,]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِمْرَأَةٌ جَائِلَةُ الوِشَاحَيْنِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>A woman slender in the
waist.</i> (Z, TA.)

